Responses must never include:

- password hashes;
- OTP codes or OTP hashes;
- session token hashes;
- QR token hashes;
- display credential hashes or raw credentials except the one-time credential response during provisioning;
- raw provider payloads;
- stack traces;
- internal SQL errors.

